WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:14.089
Mr. Scary was very upset.

2
00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:16.756
He wrung his hands.

3
00:00:16.757 --> 00:00:19.321
He paced the floor.

4
00:00:19.322 --> 00:00:23.205
Beads of sweat dripped down his forehead.

5
00:00:23.206 --> 00:00:28.496
"The vegetable parade is supposed to start in twenty minutes," he cried.

6
00:00:28.497 --> 00:00:32.660
"A hundred people will be coming, and they are expecting a parade.

7
00:00:32.661 --> 00:00:35.391
What am I going to do?"

8
00:00:35.392 --> 00:00:38.366
Suddenly Mr. Chen stood up.

9
00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:41.322
"I'm a magician," he said.

10
00:00:41.323 --> 00:00:44.042
"Maybe I can help you."

11
00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:46.808
Mr. Scary scowled at him.

12
00:00:46.809 --> 00:00:51.240
"Can you make vegetables reappear?" he asked.

13
00:00:51.241 --> 00:00:53.936
"No," said Mr. Chen.

14
00:00:53.937 --> 00:00:56.756
"But I can put on a fabulous magic show.

15
00:00:56.757 --> 00:01:00.333
I brought along some of my props."

16
00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:04.782
"My dad is a great magician!" said Jenny.

17
00:01:04.783 --> 00:01:08.730
"People love his tricks," added Josh.

18
00:01:08.731 --> 00:01:11.480
Mr. Scary was still frowning.

19
00:01:11.481 --> 00:01:16.561
"Are you sure you can entertain one hundred people?" he asked.

20
00:01:16.562 --> 00:01:19.640
"Yes," said Mr. Chen.

21
00:01:19.641 --> 00:01:25.544
"Well, okay, but your show had better be good!" said Mr. Scary.

22
00:01:25.545 --> 00:01:30.477
"I'll go to my room and get my magic things," he told Mr. Scary.

23
00:01:30.478 --> 00:01:31.944
"Just one thing:

24
00:01:31.945 --> 00:01:35.490
do you have a chicken I can borrow for my first trick?"

25
00:01:35.491 --> 00:01:39.311
Mr. Scary looked surprised, but he nodded.

26
00:01:39.312 --> 00:01:43.322
"Yes, we have chickens here," he said.

27
00:01:43.323 --> 00:01:46.631
"They lay fresh eggs for breakfast."

28
00:01:46.632 --> 00:01:48.781
"A chicken?" I thought.

29
00:01:48.782 --> 00:01:51.558
What was Mr. Chen going to use a chicken for?

30
00:01:51.559 --> 00:01:55.021
I hoped he wasn't going to make chicken soup!

31
00:01:55.022 --> 00:01:58.054
I heard Mr. Chen whisper to Josh.

32
00:01:58.055 --> 00:02:00.492
"Can you come upstairs with me to get Bunch?

33
00:02:00.493 --> 00:02:03.494
I'll need him for my last trick."

34
00:02:03.495 --> 00:02:08.438
Josh went upstairs with Mr. Chen.

35
00:02:08.439 --> 00:02:11.764
Mr. Scary left too.

36
00:02:11.765 --> 00:02:16.076
Mr. Scary came back a few minutes later, carrying a chicken.

37
00:02:16.077 --> 00:02:19.425
"Cluck! Cluck!" squawked the chicken.

38
00:02:19.426 --> 00:02:24.345
Families were beginning to file in for the vegetable parade.

39
00:02:24.346 --> 00:02:30.484
Mr. Scary walked to the front of the room.

40
00:02:30.485 --> 00:02:32.972
He was still holding the chicken.

41
00:02:32.973 --> 00:02:36.126
"I have an announcement," he said.

42
00:02:36.127 --> 00:02:40.594
"We will not be having our family vegetable parade today."

43
00:02:40.595 --> 00:02:44.748
"Boo!" someone yelled.

44
00:02:44.749 --> 00:02:48.859
"What a shame," said a woman in a blue hat.

45
00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:52.804
"I wanted to learn how to make vegetable soup."

46
00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:58.415
"I was really excited about the vegetable parade," added a little kid in the front.

47
00:02:58.416 --> 00:03:02.969
"I wanted to see the celery march into the soup pot!"

48
00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:06.996
Mr. Scary held his hand up for silence.

49
00:03:06.997 --> 00:03:10.727
"I know how disappointing this is," he said.

50
00:03:10.728 --> 00:03:15.972
"But instead of a vegetable parade, we are having a magic show."

51
00:03:15.973 --> 00:03:20.084
By now more families had come into the Lake Lounge.

52
00:03:20.085 --> 00:03:23.549
They heard Mr. Scary's announcement.

53
00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:29.075
"Yay! A magic show!" cried a little girl in pigtails.

54
00:03:29.076 --> 00:03:30.582
"That's so cool!"

55
00:03:30.583 --> 00:03:33.299
said a tall boy sitting in the back.

56
00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:37.949
"I love magic shows," said a red-haired woman.

57
00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:45.136
I agreed. A magic show was much more fun than a vegetable parade.

58
00:03:45.137 --> 00:03:50.996
But Mr. Scary looked surprised that people were excited about the magic show.

59
00:03:50.997 --> 00:03:56.368
Soon Mr. Chen came back with his big suitcase of magic things.

60
00:03:56.369 --> 00:04:01.157
Josh came with him, leading Bunch on his leash.

61
00:04:01.158 --> 00:04:04.655
Mr. Chen quickly set up his first trick.

62
00:04:04.656 --> 00:04:12.257
"Ladies and gentlemen, boys and girls," he said, "I am going to begin with a spectacular trick."

63
00:04:12.258 --> 00:04:16.766
"What is it?" called the tall boy in the back of the room.

64
00:04:16.767 --> 00:04:20.769
Mr. Chen took the chicken from Mr. Scary.

65
00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:27.471
"For my first trick, I am going to pull this chicken's head off!" Mr. Chen exclaimed.

66
00:04:27.472 --> 00:04:30.723
The audience gasped.

67
00:04:30.724 --> 00:04:32.862
Mr. Chen grinned.

68
00:04:32.863 --> 00:04:38.214
"And then," he went on, "I'm going to stick it right back on again."

69
00:04:38.215 --> 00:04:41.096
"Hooray!" I shouted.

70
00:04:41.097 --> 00:04:45.445
"Whew!" said the little girl with pigtails.

71
00:04:45.446 --> 00:04:50.921
"Squawk!" said the chicken.
